{"id":53203,"date":"2026-07-09T06:31:38","date_gmt":"2026-07-09T05:31:38","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/eco-meia-maratona-de-coimbra\/"},"modified":"2026-10-07T11:14:56","modified_gmt":"2026-10-07T10:14:56","slug":"eco-meia-maratona-de-coimbra","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/eco-meia-maratona-de-coimbra\/","title":{"rendered":"Eco Meia Maratona de Coimbra 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Eco Meia Maratona de Coimbra 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Eco Meia Maratona de Coimbra 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>11 de outubro de 2026<\/strong>, tendo como palco nevr\u00e1lgico o <strong>Parque de Estacionamento da Mata Nacional do Choupal<\/strong>, em <strong>Coimbra<\/strong>. Aliando o atletismo popular \u00e0 sustentabilidade ambiental, a prova decorre num dos pulm\u00f5es verdes mais emblem\u00e1ticos do pa\u00eds, em percursos totalmente planos e fora de asfalto.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa oficial do evento promovido pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva 4 Esta\u00e7\u00f5es<\/strong> com o apoio do munic\u00edpio \u00e9 composto pela <strong>Corrida 10 km Eco<\/strong> e pela <strong>Caminhada de 7 km<\/strong>, ambas com partida \u00e0s <strong>10h00<\/strong>. O secretariado e levantamento de dorsais funciona no s\u00e1bado das 15h00 \u00e0s 18h00 e no domingo das 08h00 \u00e0s 09h30 no Parque do Choupal.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem atrav\u00e9s da plataforma GoinOnline, garantindo aos participantes dorsal personalizado, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica com chip, medalh\u00e3o finisher oficial, seguro desportivo e refor\u00e7o de abastecimento na mata e na meta.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; w