"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada Ecol\u00f3gica<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 11 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 11.50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 23\/07)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 12.50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (24\/07 a 25\/08)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 3:<\/strong> 14.50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (26\/08 a 27\/09)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Crian\u00e7as (<12 anos):<\/strong> 3.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (fase \u00fanica)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando se realiza a Eco Meia Maratona de Coimbra 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no domingo, 11 de outubro de 2026, com partidas da corrida de 10 km e da caminhada de 7 km \u00e0s 10h00 na Mata Nacional do Choupal, Coimbra.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tipo de piso e percurso da prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O percurso \u00e9 100% plano e decorre em caminhos de terra batida compacta e alamedas sombreadas no interior da Mata Nacional do Choupal e margens do rio Mondego, fora de asfalto.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis nesta edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa oficial conta com a Corrida 10 km Eco (competitiva com cronometragem por chip) e a Caminhada de 7 km (sem car\u00e1ter competitivo).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando posso levantar o dorsal e kit de atleta?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona no Parque de Estacionamento do Choupal no dia 10 de outubro (15h00 \u00e0s 18h00) e no dia da prova, 11 de outubro (08h00 \u00e0s 09h30).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial e fazer a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online na plataforma GoinOnline e o regulamento completo com normas e escal\u00f5es est\u00e1 dispon\u00edvel no portal oficial da organiza\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Eco Meia Maratona de Coimbra 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-11\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Coimbra\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Coimbra\", \"addressRegion\": \"Coimbra\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando se realiza a Eco Meia Maratona de Coimbra 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no domingo, 11 de outubro de 2026, com partidas da corrida de 10 km e da caminhada de 7 km \u00e0s 10h00 na Mata Nacional do Choupal, Coimbra.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o tipo de piso e percurso da prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O percurso \u00e9 100% plano e decorre em caminhos de terra batida compacta e alamedas sombreadas no interior da Mata Nacional do Choupal e margens do rio Mondego, fora de asfalto.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis nesta edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa oficial conta com a Corrida 10 km Eco (competitiva com cronometragem por chip) e a Caminhada de 7 km (sem car\u00e1ter competitivo).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e quando posso levantar o dorsal e kit de atleta?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O secretariado funciona no Parque de Estacionamento do Choupal no dia 10 de outubro (15h00 \u00e0s 18h00) e no dia da prova, 11 de outubro (08h00 \u00e0s 09h30).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial e fazer a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online na plataforma GoinOnline e o regulamento completo com normas e escal\u00f5es est\u00e1 dispon\u00edvel no portal oficial da organiza\u00e7\u00e3o.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66818,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,28],"event_type_2":[37,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-53203","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thum